@startuml
autonumber
actor "Sinh Viên" as Student
participant "Front-End" as UI
participant "Cloud Storage\n(AWS S3 / Cloudinary)" as Cloud
participant "Course Service" as CourseSvc
database "MySQL Database" as DB

Student -> UI: Chọn File & Nhấn "Nộp bài"
UI -> Cloud: Tải tệp tin (Upload File Stream)
Cloud --> UI: Trả về File_URL an toàn
UI -> CourseSvc: POST /api/v1/course-service/assessments/{assessmentId}/submit (AssessmentID, File_URLs, Text)
CourseSvc -> DB: Insert `submissions` (student_id, assessment_id, submitted_at)
CourseSvc -> DB: Insert `submission_attachments` (attachment_url, original_name)
DB --> CourseSvc: Xác nhận thành công
CourseSvc --> UI: 200 OK
UI --> Student: Hiển thị trạng thái "Nộp bài thành công"
@enduml